# CODEOWNERS — automatic reviewer assignment
#
# Place at .github/CODEOWNERS in each repository.
# Replace the placeholder handles with real GitHub usernames before committing.
#
# Pairs with branch protection: "Require review from Code Owners".
# The goal is that no PR can be self-approved (AGENTS.md §6).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default: any change needs a platform reviewer
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*                               @sintratel-docket-platform/platform

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Governance — changing the rules requires broader agreement
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
